# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# IV-053: the pointer carries a translucent picture of what the drag
# holds, drawn over whatever it crosses so the drop target stays readable.
wait 12
note the bare backdrop first, where the picture will be
expect-pixel 609 447 336698
press-row 1 1
wait 2
move 300 450
wait 2
move 600 450
wait 3
note the carried file's icon rides at the pointer, tinted translucent
expect-pixel 609 447 b9c8b1
quit
